      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are trapped in a cycle where you believe your existence is a burden, and that feeling of being a problem is incredibly isolating. If you are truly feeling like you are a weight that needs to be lifted, please know that there are people who want to help you carry that weight right now. You do not have to go through this pain alone; reaching out to a crisis line can provide immediate support.",
